  "{percent} of players who said they were certain got this wrong.": "「確信あり」と答えたプレイヤーの{percent}が間違えた。",
  "Caught {caught} of the {played} days played this week": "今週プレイした{played}日のうち{caught}日で罠を見抜いた",
